eenshot (2).png", "id": "6882517855134571", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031344_6882517861801237_7491338628550035453_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NFSTFVVx2RkQ7kNvwE2zp6O&_nc_oc=AdlNxNgf3giPupqmjoy8Fmw8i99hn461eCrdRBX9_81zK0Iu7AxEuwiocJjEqIA8fs8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw9vZIam0vj_lEW8PtNTvHP8JVbSIW-AmnIX1acMuAREw&oe=69B2A864"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Oculus Screenshot (5).png", "id": "1502415067247993", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001670_1502415070581326_41715781668599962_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tTvOSEv9vZYQ7kNvwFi3ysi&_nc_oc=Adl0IUceNd6_NyHPjicrvTMZZF3KdsVWc8Eu5sz3Mit_okwRUrAR2WQEY0lCYCzpzwE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz9NeVAr8jIoy1sBcJ238jK2W-mXAWsLl3IaHIS0MEamg&oe=69B2A0D7"}, "display_name": "Shoot the Robots", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Good old 'shoot-em-all' returns, now in VR! Now in futuristic environment filled by robots, drones and flying cars!\n\nIn this fast-paced game you have to shoot the running robots, who try escape your gun-point in any way: running, jumping, crawling, riding cars. Take your favourite pistol into your hand, and enjoy sophisticated animations of how robots fall from your well-aimed shots\n\nKey game features:\n- Super enjoyable robots death aniamtions\n- Futuristic city environment\n- A lot of 'Mods' to customize your game experience in radical way", "short_description": "Do you love shooting? What about robots? And what about shooting the robots? In this fast-paced game you have to use a well-aimed shots to neutralize robots which will run away from you in every possible way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/shoot-the-robots-vr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Martysh", "support_website_url": null,